<title>USA: U.S. 1996 soybeans in major states -USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. 1996 soybeans in major states -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA final 1996 soybean production and yields in major states, and final revised 1995.</p>
<p>    PRODUCTION, 1,000 bushels:    YIELD, bushels/acre:</p>
<p> -	  1996--Prev.96    1995    1996-Prev.96  1995</p>
<p> Ill   398,925  403,850  378,300   40.5   41.0   39.0</p>
<p> Ind   203,680  209,040  196,710   38.0   39.0   39.5</p>
<p> Iowa  415,800  415,800  407,440   44.0   44.0   44.0</p>
<p> Minn  224,200  224,200  234,900   38.0   38.0   40.5</p>
<p> Mo    149,850  157,950  132,750   37.0   39.0   29.5</p>
<p> Neb   135,450  138,460  100,980   45.0   46.0   33.0</p>
<p> Ohio  157,150  157,150  153,140   35.0   35.0   38.0</p>
</text>
